note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note gpu/forge/realize.om: Deterministic FORGE realization planner, AEGIS
note integrity token sealing/verification, and canonical receipt emitter.
note Ported from physics-mv (forge/forge_realize.{h,c}, forge/v2/forge_substrate_v2.c).
note Composable OM-2 library module (compose after hardware.om, envelope.om, provider.om).

